      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd go as far as to say this behaviour should be changed entirely. This is really scummy. If I pay for a month of something I'd expect to have it for a month. Hitting 'cancel' is generally seen as a method of stopping auto-renew, not immediately clearing your benefits.\n\nPlease consider changing this. Why would someone want to immediately lose something they bought?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "656e33595a584e8bbf16983f",
