  "details": "I got curious and was wondering what cancelling a subscription did. When I read the wording of the pop-up confirming the cancellation, I was immediately confused because I thought that it would be pointless to have the cancel button if nothing happens. Then I clicked confirm and realized that my benefits were gone a few minutes later.\n\nPlease change this wording in the pop-up to let users be certain that their paid benefits will immediately end when they confirm to cancel a subscription.",
